EN:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Hey! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}I hope you're just clumsy and
not straight-up mean. {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}It's not nice
to plonk someone like that.{{TAG:000B:0003:03CD}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}¡Oye! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Más te vale que haya sido sin
querer, flor. ¡No puedes ir por ahí
golpeando a los demás!{{TAG:000B:0003:03CD}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Hé ! {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}J'ose espérer que tu ne l'as pas
fait exprès !{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Ça fait mal tu sais !
Fais attention !{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000B:0003:03CD}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Cosa ti prende?! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Spero che tu sia
soltanto maldestr{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} e che non
lo faccia apposta. {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Non è carino!!!{{TAG:000B:0003:03CD}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Huch! {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}Entschuldige mal!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Was ist das
denn für rüpelhaftes Benehmen?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich hoffe, das war ein Versehen.{{TAG:000B:0003:03CD}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Hey! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Umarım sadece sakarsındır da düpedüz
kabalık etmiyorsundur. {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Birine öyle pat diye
vurmak hiç hoş değil.{{TAG:000B:0003:03CD}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Where did you learn your manners—{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
in a boxing ring?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Try having more
class!{{TAG:000B:0003:03CD}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Ma non ti hanno insegnato le buone
maniere?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Assumi un comportamento
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}da signorina per bene! {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Te ne prego!{{TAG:000B:0003:03CD}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}He!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Was ist denn das für ein
Benehmen?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} So geht man doch
nicht mit einer Dame um!{{TAG:000B:0003:03CD}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Basta! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Sbattimi di nuovo quel coso
in testa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} e ti faccio
vedere io come si usa veramente!{{TAG:000B:0004:03CD}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Hey! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Şununla bana bir daha vurursan,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} onu gerçekten nasıl kullanacağını
ben sana gösteririm!{{TAG:000B:0004:03CD}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Are you trying to start some sort of
rivalry with me,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I warn
you: {{TAG:0003:0028:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}this is a game you will lose.{{TAG:000B:0004:03CD}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Estás buscando pelea,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Te aconsejo que lo dejes o vas a
salir mal parada.{{TAG:000B:0004:03CD}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Möchtest du eine Rivalität mit mir
anzetteln?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Oder was soll dieses
rüpelhafte Benehmen?
Ich kann dich nur vorwarnen:{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}
Du willst gewiss nicht meinen
Zorn auf dich ziehen!{{TAG:000B:0004:03CD}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Benimle bir rekabet mi başlatmaya
çalışıyorsun,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Uyarıyorum: {{TAG:0003:0028:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}bu oyunu
kaybedersin.{{TAG:000B:0004:03CD}}
